hat expires loses 10. The best level is about the forecast or a little below. Candidate 4 orders about 1.25 times the forecast and will waste stock.\n\n**Scale of each plan against forecast (2-day plans)**\n\n| Candidate | Product 0 | Product 1 | Note |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 5 | ~1.2× | ~0.95× | closest to the best mix |\n| 7 | ~1.15× | ~1.15× | smaller orders at the end, so less waste |\n| 3 | ~1.1× | ~1.1× | |\n| 4 | ~1.25× | ~1.25× | too much product 1 |\n| 1 | 1.0× | 1.0× | too little product 0 |\n\nMy guess for the best half is 5, 7, 3 and 4. Candidates 6, 0 and 1 are close behind, and 2 is clearly worst."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4427, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2313, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 4427}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-28T22:48:12.450Z", "request_id": "req_011CgVT1P33akjU86uvY8Tcc"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01KMeftJDwtC1EVFYTiBBBph", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgVT1PHRt8WPQtttWxpya", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01KMeftJDwtC1EVFYTiBBBph", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p": [0.35, 0.35, 0.2, 0.65, 0.55, 0.75, 0.45, 0.7]}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2,